## 🌍 Google Reviews Integration

```ts
// lib/google-places.ts
// Use Google Places API (New) — place details with reviews field
// Endpoint: GET https://places.googleapis.com/v1/places/{PLACE_ID}
// Headers: X-Goog-Api-Key, X-Goog-FieldMask: reviews,rating,userRatingCount

// /api/reviews/route.ts
// Cache response for 6 hours using Next.js fetch cache:
// fetch(url, { next: { revalidate: 21600 } })
// Return: { reviews: Review[], rating: number, totalRatings: number }
```

`.env.local` keys needed:
```
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=           # Your agency's Google Maps Place ID
```

---

## ⚙️ API Routes Design

| Method | Route | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/services` | Public | All published services |
| POST | `/api/services` | Admin | Create service |
| GET | `/api/services/[id]` | Admin | Single service |
| PATCH | `/api/services/[id]` | Admin | Update service |
| DELETE | `/api/services/[id]` | Admin | Delete service |
| POST | `/api/contact` | Public | Send contact email |
| GET | `/api/reviews` | Public | Cached Google reviews |

All API routes:
- Return consistent `{ success, data, error }` shape
- Use Zod to parse request body; return 400 with field errors on failure
- Admin routes verify session via `auth()` from NextAuth; return 401 if missing

