### GitHub Repository Setup

**Branch Protection Rules** (set in repo Settings → Branches):
- `main`: require PR, require CI pass, no force push, require 1 approving review
- `develop`: require CI pass, no force push

**Required GitHub Secrets:**

| Secret | Description |
|---|---|
| `VERCEL_TOKEN` | Vercel personal access token |
| `VERCEL_ORG_ID` | From `vercel link` |
| `VERCEL_PROJECT_ID` | From `vercel link` |
| `DATABASE_URL_CI` | CI test DB connection string |
| `DATABASE_URL_PREVIEW` | Preview env DB |
| `DATABASE_URL_PROD` | Production DB |
| `NEXTAUTH_SECRET` | Shared across envs |
| `GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY` | Google Places API |
| `UPLOADTHING_SECRET` | Uploadthing |
| `RESEND_API_KEY` | Resend email |
| `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL` | Deploy notifications |

