## ✅ Execution Priority

When implementing this project, follow this order first before expanding the rest of the app:

1. `prisma/schema.prisma`
2. `lib/env.ts`
3. `lib/auth.ts`
4. `middleware.ts`
5. Public layout and landing page components

Always preserve the stack, architecture, and quality requirements defined above.
